# format_note : This header is parsed as YAML after all leading whitespace is stripped, so keep every entry on one line and avoid apostrophes
# name : LRIS-2 imaging optics throughput
# description : Throughput of the LRIS-2 camera optics in imaging mode
# author : BPH
# source : none - invented placeholder
# date_created : 2026-08-20
# date_modified : 2026-08-20
# status : PLACEHOLDER - flat 0.70, invented. Replace before any sensitivity work.
# type : instrument:transmission
# action : transmission
# wavelength_unit : um
# notes :
# - Covers the CAMERA ONLY. Telescope mirrors are NOT included.
# - The collimator is NOT included here. It is the SurfaceList on LIST_LRIS-2_collimator.dat.
# - The dichroic is NOT included here either. It is a separate effect on TER_LRIS-2_dichroic.dat.
# - When a real curve replaces this placeholder, make sure it excludes the dichroic or it double-counts.
# - Keck mirrors come from Keck/LIST_keck_mirrors.dat via the SurfaceList in Keck.yaml.
# - Do not add the Keck mirrors here as well, or M1 gets counted twice.
# - Grid spans 0.30-1.10 um so it still covers the band if SIM.spectral is widened.
# - Reflection carries the lost light and emissivity is 0, so this adds no thermal
# - emission. Harmless below 1.1 um, and it avoids a spurious background.
# changes :
# - 2026-08-20 (BPH) created as a placeholder
#
wavelength  transmission    reflection      emissivity
0.29        0.00            1.00            0
0.30        0.70            0.30            0
1.10        0.70            0.30            0
1.11        0.00            1.00            0
